<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Venezuelan basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Venezuelan basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Gurnsey) has issued 750,000 European-style call warrants, on a Venezuelan equity basket, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>The basket includes shares of CANTV (ADR), Electricidad de Caracas, Sivensa, Mavesa and Mantex.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one reference basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $27.50		    PREMIUM	29.00 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $4.77		     GEARING	5.24 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $25.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
